  "description": "*\"Look carefully at what you asked.\"*\n\nHong Cha-Eun, the only daughter of the owner of the Kkulkkul Gamjatang restaurant. Kwon Hae-Gang, a national swimming team member and the son of the chairman of the Seun Private School Foundation. The only thing they had in common was that they were in the same school and class. However, after Hae-Gang accidentally discovers their secret, a tenacious and vicious feud begins...\n\nEight years after a terrible breakup, they reunite. From feuding to coworkers, what's next?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
